Trina AX

This repository contains the filtered Team AX core, the shared cloud
protocols, and the Trina edition and website additions. The separately
licensed hosting control plane (ee/) is not part of this repository or its
history. See docs/UPSTREAM.md for provenance and docs/PUBLICATION.md for
publication conditions.

Preserve the copyright notices and authorship of Team AX and incorporated
third-party components. The accompanying LICENSE preserves the Team AX
GNU Affero General Public License version 3 text. Trina edition additions
are designated AGPL-3.0-only; this does not grant rights to third-party or
separately licensed material.

Component-specific scope:
- shared/src/cloud-protocol/ has its own MIT LICENSE, which is retained.
- ee/ (the hosting control plane) is excluded and stays private. The Trina
  edition loads its contracts at run time from a separate checkout
  (TRINA_CORE_ROOT); no ee/ code or grant is included here.
- Saram/chat-proto-derived code: the copyright holder (Potenlab) confirmed
  on 2026-10-27 that it may be published under AGPL-3.0-only.
- pptx-preview@1.0.7 is used as an npm dependency. Its package metadata says
  ISC; the author's current repository LICENSE restricts source publication.
  This is recorded as an open item in docs/PUBLICATION.md.
- Historical website source retains its Apache-2.0 license and Trina Inc.
  attribution in editions/trina/branding/. Font notices remain under the
  website public/fonts/ directory. The modified Korean subsets are named
  Trina UI; public/fonts/NOTICE-Trina-UI.txt records the naming changes.
  Website public/licenses/ includes the
  Apache and AGPL texts and a website-specific notice for static builds.

